            {
              "id": "text_CGwgPMJs",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 512,
              "top": 306,
              "width": 424,
              "height": 204,
              "rotate": 0,
              "content": "<p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:20px;line-height:24px;color:#f59e0b;font-weight:780;\">函数判定</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 5px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#374151;\"><span style=\"color:#f59e0b;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> 存在性：每个 <span class=\"math-engine-inline\" data-syntara-math=\"inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 都必须有输出。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 5px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#374151;\"><span style=\"color:#f59e0b;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> 唯一性：同一个输入不能配到两个不同输出。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 5px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#374151;\"><span style=\"color:#f59e0b;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> 陪域是允许输出的空间，值域是实际出现的输出。</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#374151",
              "textType": "item",
              "lineHeight": 1.35,
              "fill": "#f8fafc",
